Xerxes king god demon~
King Xerxes the Mad~
King Xerxes smiles as you enter and says, "Ahh, mortals! Are you ready to die?"
~
The thing standing before you may have been human once, but it's obvious this
is no longer the case. He appears much like a perfectly proportioned human
male, but his glowing emerald eyes and fanged smile betray a more sinister,
demonic nature. Once a kind, benevolent man, it's quite clear the King is now
wholly insane and unutterably evil.
~
