high priestess Lucindar~
Lucindar~
Lucindar, the High Priestess of Xerxes has been waiting for you.
~
Lucindar has ebony black skin, bat-like scaled wings, a forked tail and small
demonic horns that poke through her long, dark hair. She is quite tall, almost
seven feet in height. Her body is voluptuous and well-muscled in a feminine
way. She has been the High Priestess since the fall of Thalos ten thousand
years ago, and Xerxes has bestowed many dark blessings upon her. She fixes her
glowing red eyes upon you and your blood runs cold.
~
